       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFORM-TIMES.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COUNTER     PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 REPEATS     PIC 9(2) VALUE 4.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM 3 TIMES
               DISPLAY "HELLO"
           END-PERFORM
           PERFORM REPEATS TIMES
               ADD 10 TO COUNTER
           END-PERFORM
           PERFORM SHOW-COUNTER 2 TIMES
           STOP RUN.

       SHOW-COUNTER.
           DISPLAY "COUNTER: " COUNTER
           ADD 1 TO COUNTER.
